        "description": "URL of a stored artifact — exported video, source, voiceover audio, SRT or thumbnail. Fetch the file from `downloadUrl`: for a workspace with private media it is signed and expires at `downloadUrlExpiresAt` (request it again for a fresh one); otherwise it equals `url` and never expires.\n\n**Scope:** `videos:read`",
